<title>UK: BP sets Jan LPG price at $367/$273 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets Jan LPG price at $367/$273 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum on Monday announced its official price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP, at $367 a tonne for propane and $273 a tonne for butane. The price will be valid for January.</p>
<p>This is an increase from December's propane price of $323 a tonne and butane price of $265.50 a tonne.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
